Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.57,0:00:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Handler 1 to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.43,0:00:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Multiple enemy interceptor\Ngroups at points 30 and 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.29,0:00:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Battalion-sized units of\NLuvas and Growlwolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All Juggernauts, advance\Nimmediately and take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta say,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.99,0:00:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though, with that many of them, I don't\Nthink any of you are coming back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So go! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move, you pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight until your bodies break !
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,86, scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.54,0:00:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,*Screaming*
