Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.62,0:01:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anyone out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.53,0:01:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by day can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's another beautiful day in all\N85 districts around the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.26,0:02:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not enjoy some fun with\Nyour friends and family?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clear skies
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.55,0:02:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,might not complete your\Nwhole crew tomorrow ,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you can keep those umbrellas at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a great weekend, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, for today's War Update\Nfrom San Magnolia Military HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The invasion of the Giardian\NEmpire's mechanized infantry drones,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.20,0:02:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,also known as Legion,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.98,0:02:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attacked in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Combat District 17 and has been repelled\Nby our nation's unmanned combat units.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.59,0:02:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,great and powerful\Njuggernauts and this blow
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,delivered to their forces\Ncame at minimal cost
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.91,0:02:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thanks to our advanced\Nethically responsible
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,drone units our nation\Nhas suffered zero human
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.12,0:02:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fatalities the day is\Nnear when our righteous
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and just nation will\Nfinally smash the last
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.13,0:02:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remnants of the wicked empire glory to\Nson magnolia and the five-color flag
