Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, real men Hold on, hold\Non Oh, Major, good morning
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.33,0:03:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you bet I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.03,0:03:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know my way around, don't worry They were
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really crying their heads off\Nyesterday Goddamn pigs That
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.95,0:03:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fight was insane I bet I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lost five of the things Lucky for\Nus that no people were on board
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.98,0:03:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, guys The
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.13,0:03:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doll-loving princess has given us the\Nevil eye Come on, Major Millie Zay why
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the long face you shouldn't cry over a few
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.57,0:03:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,busted up drones listen\Nhere good morning good
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,morning annette you're up early today you\Nusually sleep in work had me up all night
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unlike those morons i do\Nmy job just forget about
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those jer ks this isn't\Nthe battlefield we're
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.24,0:03:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inside the grand mur and the enemy\Nwill be gone in two years if anything
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.89,0:03:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're the weirdo for taking all\Nthis military stuff so seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.34,0:04:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply think this\Ncountry's conscience has...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.52,0:04:01.06,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1335.86,762.14)\c&H050505&\blur1\p1}m -20 19 l 128 97 140 78 -5 3
Dialogue: 2,0:04:00.52,0:04:01.06,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1335.86,762.14)\frz333.6\fry-5\fax-0.36\fnMolecula Semibold\fs28\c&HDC9506&\blur1.1}Vladilena Milizé
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you do, Miss Serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.09,0:04:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm not awake enough to listen\Nto another one of your speeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.08,0:04:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's his problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a processor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glorified gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, screw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since when do District\N1 men like us have to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,listen to the bitching of\Nthe pigs in District 86.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you care so much about the drones?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and how they're treated, Lena?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.97,0:04:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We both know that they aren't drones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.13,0:04:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me try that again, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it you care so much about the 86?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.76,0:04:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The battlefield is calling, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Confirming ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Major Vladilena Milizé.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eastern Theater Forces, Combat District 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defense Line 3 Command\Nand Control Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pararate. Activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Synchronization target.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleiades. Processor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Synchronization complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Handler 1 to Pleiades.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to be working with you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleiades to Handler One.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sync channel clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's about to enter firing\Nrange, so take care not to get...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:05:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 86 are inhuman, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why are you always so kind to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.93,0:06:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very sweet, Miss Human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.50,0:06:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to assign me to a\Nnew unit, General Karlstahl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the unit's handlers\Nis retiring from his post.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.21,0:06:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, a capable replacement\Nis needed immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they can't
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leave their post until\Na successor is decided ,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.06,0:06:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does that mean the unit's\Ndefending a key base?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defense Line 1 in Eastern\NCombat District 1, a.k.a.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.34,0:06:33.22,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,626.8)\fscx112\fscy97\frz-14.6\fry-2\frx3\fax-0.13\fnJMH Typewriter\fs18\c&H13338E&\blur0.95}S
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.99,0:06:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Spearhead Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's made up of veterans from\Nall across the Eastern Theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're nothing short of an ace unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.81,0:06:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible, but I only just made major.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.90,0:06:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I can\Nhandle a unit like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say that as though you're not the\Nyoungest person ever to achieve the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.95,0:06:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rank of major.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being overly humble can\Nturn people against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lena, that's good advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Uncle Jerome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:07:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that Vatslav would be so proud\Nif only he could see his daughter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's Margaretta?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother's the same as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She won't stop telling me to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.69,0:07:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't find a single\Nhandler to take this post.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.51,0:07:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're an ace unit. Right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.49,0:07:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't it be a high\Nhonor for any Republic
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soldier to take command of such capable
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On paper, yes, one would think so,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but take a look at the\Ncommander's call sign: Undertaker.
