Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've taken to calling it the Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It destroys any handler who\Ntries to take control of it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The processor destroys the handler?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.29,0:07:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not the other way around? Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not just an urban legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time in my schedule to\Nshare urban legends with my subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost every handler who's\Ndealt with a unit with Undert
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aker in it has retired or\Nrequested to change units.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:08:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some have even committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's hard to believe,\Nbut they claim to be haunted by
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the voices of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dead, you're more than\Nwelcome to turn this down, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You work too hard anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A handler's job is to monitor the\Nunit, keep their commands to a minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be Spearhead's next\Ncommand and control officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they'll give it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be doing\Nanything more than your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.82,0:08:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For that matter, I wish you'd stop\Ntrying to interact with the processors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a commander's job to know her men.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.17,0:08:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are to stop including the number\Nof fatalities in your reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Officially, there are no\Nhumans on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means that there are no fatalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean we should ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.20,0:08:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These things we're doing,\Nthey're completely immoral.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lena.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are just like\Nyour father, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Henceforth, Major Vladilena Miliz.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the designated handler for Combat\NDistrict 1, handling Defense Line 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure to get the paperwork done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.64,0:09:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.26,0:09:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will give it my all,\Nuntil my last mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you accepted?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.76,0:09:26.51,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=15}{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\bord2\1a&HFF&\3a&H30&\blur5\fscx90\b0}Republic of San Magnolia Military Research Wing
Dialogue: 2,0:09:23.76,0:09:26.51,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\bord1\c&H000000&\blur0.5\fscx90\b0}Republic of San Magnolia Military Research Wing
Dialogue: 3,0:09:23.76,0:09:26.51,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=16}{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\blur0.5\fscx90\b0}Republic of San Magnolia Military Research Wing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.78,0:09:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you even realize how\Nweird you are come on it's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an honor to be put in charge\Nof an ace unit it's an
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,important job and that\Nstuff about destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hand lers that's got to be made up right i
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bet they didn't care about their jobs and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just wanted a reason to\Nleave some of them did
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.53,0:09:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,commit suicide though one\Nof the spearhead squadron's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.39,0:09:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,handlers went crazy and blew\Nhis own head off with a shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, exam's all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another clean bill of health.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.35,0:10:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but why commit suicide we got\Na request to look into it they
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thought it might be a problem with the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,para raid quitting isn't a big deal\Nbut a suicide needs to be looked
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.90,0:10:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Into and I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't know i mean the handler was already\Ndead it's not like we could interview
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.48,0:10:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him pretty defeatist for the head of\Nthe development team hey we did our job
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,besides there was nothing wrong\Nwith the raid device end of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.94,0:10:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,story we told them that if they\Nwanted to know more they'd have to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bring us the undertaker those idiots and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.03,0:10:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,transport were all this flight\Nhas no available seating
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.01,0:10:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for pigs so did you get to\Ntalk to undertaker we had
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to settle for its report a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whole lot of nothing we told it about the\Ndead handler and its response was just i
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.69,0:10:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see well it's an 86 it's\Nnot entirely possible
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.62,0:10:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that a para raid could\Ncause insanity it puts extra
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.38,0:10:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pressure on part of the\Nbrain to allow it to share
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sensory data with someone\Nelse which is precisely why
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:10:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we only use it to share hearing if you\Ntried to sink your vision too it'd burn
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.99,0:11:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out your brain too much load on the brain\Nand you don't come back using the pair
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,raid means accepting those\Nrisks your father was one of the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.51,0:11:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,authorities in the field and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.58,0:11:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still the fundamental principles were all
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.23,0:11:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,developed by someone else\Nthere's a lot i even don't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know to be honest seriously\Nlena you should join
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.05,0:11:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us in r&d huh the military\Nis basically a jobs
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,program right now in two years when
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the legion are gone ex-military isn't\Ngoing to mean a thing on your resume thank
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you but we're in wartime\Nright now those processors
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are all nuts you know that\Nright and who's to say what
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.39,0:11:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happens on those para raids\Nthe 86 die all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so i'm not worried about them\Nbut i don't want that for
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you running away now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would be cowardly yeah yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.09,0:12:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you really are weird i\Nupdated your settings for you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thank you hold on lena i\Nmade chiffon cake you want a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slice i think i'll pass\Ntoday see you later even if i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,used real eggs and real milk
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.98,0:12:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's so good
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so how'd you like the\Nreal thing it's amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still i wonder if this is\Nhow it really tasted you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.78,0:12:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forget when you only eat the\Nartificial stuff i've got cream
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,puffs too they don't taste like cheese\Nwhen you didn't put any in or look
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ready to spit out black\Nsmoke do they you wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be referring to the cream\Npuffs i made last time would
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you my dear lena they'll\Nbe fine this time i gave
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him to a potential marriage\Npartner yesterday and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.83,0:12:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he cried tears of joy he\Nseems like a good match
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:13:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for once sounds to me\Nlike he really appreciates
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.15,0:13:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you of course he does i\Nwrapped the whole batch up
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.83,0:13:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a note addressed to\Nmy beloved and sealed it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a lipstick kiss then put him in the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mailbox of the place he\Nlives with his mistress
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.22,0:13:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleiades come
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.12,0:13:19.37,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=17}{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\bord2\1a&HFF&\3a&H30&\blur5\b0\fscx90}May 20th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 2,0:13:16.12,0:13:19.37,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\bord1\c&H000000&\blur0.5\b0\fscx90}May 20th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 3,0:13:16.12,0:13:19.37,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=18}{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\blur0.5\b0\fscx90}May 20th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in please respond Handler
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One to Pleiades stop he's dead
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.67,0:13:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.93,0:13:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Face the maneuvers! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Handler one to all members of\Nsquadron three The enemy unit has
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,commenced its retreat Squadron\Nfour will now take over your patrol
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.59,0:13:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mission Regroup at once\Nand return to base Roger
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.85,0:14:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about the seven we lost\Nabout Pleiades I'm so
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so sorry as always thank you\Nfor your oh so kind words
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Handler One just so you know Squadron
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.91,0:14:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three is going to be re-estab\Nlished you're going to be reporting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.11,0:14:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to a new Handler from here\Nforward thank you for everything
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i will be the new command and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.41,0:14:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,control officer for spearhead that's\Ngreat news you have my deepest
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sympathies handler one what do you\Nsay say hello to the reaper for me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.91,0:14:46.67,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=19}{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\bord2\1a&HFF&\3a&H30&\blur5\fad(1500,0)\b0\fscx90}May 22nd, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 2,0:14:42.91,0:14:46.67,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\bord1\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.5\fad(1500,0)\fscx90\t(1500,0,\1a&H00&)\b0}May 22nd, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 3,0:14:42.91,0:14:46.67,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=20}{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\blur0.5\fad(1500,0)\b0\fscx90}May 22nd, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pararade,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.09,0:15:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Synchronization target.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spearhead, processor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,*crickets
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chirping*
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,*crickets
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chirping*
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.05,0:15:43.06,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=21}{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\bord2\1a&HFF&\3a&H30&\blur5\b0\fscx90}May 12th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 2,0:15:40.05,0:15:43.06,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\bord1\c&H000000&\blur0.5\b0\fscx90}May 12th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 3,0:15:40.05,0:15:43.06,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=22}{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\blur0.5\b0\fscx90}May 12th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,*crickets chirping*
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,*crickets chirping*
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,*crack* *laughter* Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.85,0:15:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around and start.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're sure having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.03,0:16:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got eggs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.19,0:16:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.39,0:16:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.53,0:16:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.24,0:16:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.27,0:16:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.91,0:16:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, have fun out there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.99,0:16:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have fun out there, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.74,0:16:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Members of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.60,0:16:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spearhead,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's breakfast time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:17:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gather round. Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.11,0:17:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.53,0:17:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got more omelets if you want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want them! Hey, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.91,0:17:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even think he\Nchewed the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.15,0:17:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.51,0:17:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, the guy went crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.87,0:17:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That handle of ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.19,0:17:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, in yesterday's battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no chance he's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.79,0:17:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard everything myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.41,0:17:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was all like, hold on, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.73,0:17:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They never change, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.63,0:17:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those white pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.87,0:17:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever comes next is just going\Nto do the same damn thing. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.91,0:17:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least everybody\Nwas able to go yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.79,0:17:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.75,0:17:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if we're going to die anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,having our beloved Reaper\Nguide us isn't half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.81,0:18:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.39,0:18:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hurts...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.05,0:18:23.80,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=23}{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\bord2\1a&HFF&\3a&H30&\blur5\b0\fscx90}May 22nd, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 2,0:18:22.05,0:18:23.80,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\bord1\c&H000000&\blur0.5\b0\fscx90}May 22nd, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 3,0:18:22.05,0:18:23.80,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=24}{\an2\pos(960,930)\fnNewCinemaB Std D\fs80\fsp2\blur0.5\b0\fscx90}May 22nd, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.51,0:18:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.13,0:18:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oooooo…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shin...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.19,0:19:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me you won't forget me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.13,0:20:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.97,0:20:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cujo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,able
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.81,0:20:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to go yeah you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hear your brother's voice no i see
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.10,0:20:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,none
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.49,0:20:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:20:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.71,0:21:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Handler
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.86,0:21:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One to all
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.68,0:21:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spearhead
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.95,0:21:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,units.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.61,0:21:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am your new command and control officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I contacted you tonight\Nto introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.70,0:21:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Handler One.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Spearhead\NSquadron's combat commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call sign, Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been informed that\Nwe'd have a new Handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.11,0:21:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We look forward to working with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.74,0:21:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:22:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you, Undertaker.
